stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> validation: Partner asks about client promises
    validation --> needs_input: Exact client or paging input is invalid
    validation --> unauthorized: Verified partner authority is absent
    validation --> reading: Joe or Dell supplies valid input
    reading --> needs_input: Exact client is unknown
    reading --> unavailable: Source fails or acceptance contract is unavailable
    reading --> empty: Available source has no eligible promises
    reading --> ready: Explicit acceptance and current actions are available
    ready --> validation: Partner requests the next page
    state "Check request" as validation
    state "Name the client or correct input" as needs_input
    state "Sign in with authorized access" as unauthorized
    state "Read current accepted promises" as reading
    state "Show source unavailable and its gap" as unavailable
    state "Show no recorded promises in available sources" as empty
    state "Show promises with owners, dates and evidence" as ready
    %% Intended behavior only. No runtime implementation or passing transition claim.
    %% Never infer acceptance from generic action creation or prose alone.
    %% Never complete an action or send an introduction while reading.
